{"id":"ef06f79774aa2541","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-fractional-sobolev.md","title":"Fractional Sobolev Space","display":"df-fractional-sobolev — Fractional Sobolev Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fractional-sobolev","aliases":["58-df-fractional-sobolev"],"display":"df-fractional-sobolev — Fractional Sobolev Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-lp-space]]","[[58-df-integral]]","[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fractional-sobolev"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fractional-sobolev</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fractional-sobolev — Fractional Sobolev Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\cap\\Omega:B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\}\\land\\lambda_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\lambda^n\\upharpoonright\\Omega\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\cap\\Omega:B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\}\\land\\lambda_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\lambda^n\\upharpoonright\\Omega\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in(0,1)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\">\\(s\\in(0,1)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\">\\(u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\">\\(u=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\cdot]_{s,p;\\Omega}:L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\([\\cdot]_{s,p;\\Omega}:L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span> (Gagliardo seminorm defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{s,p}(\\Omega)\\subseteq L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\">\\(W^{s,p}(\\Omega)\\subseteq L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\)</span> (space defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}\\in[0,\\infty)^{\\Omega\\times\\Omega}\">\\(G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}\\in[0,\\infty)^{\\Omega\\times\\Omega}\\)</span> 为下式定义的核函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n\">\\(\\lambda_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^n\">\\(\\lambda^n\\)</span> 及限制测度均取 <code>58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data</code> 的规范数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 用长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的实数函数编码。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}=\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,x\\rangle,0\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\frac{|f(x)-f(y)|^p}{\\|x-y\\|_2^{n+sp}}\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in\\Omega\\land x\\ne y\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}=\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,x\\rangle,0\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\frac{|f(x)-f(y)|^p}{\\|x-y\\|_2^{n+sp}}\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in\\Omega\\land x\\ne y\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\ \\to\\ [u]_{s,p;\\Omega}=\n\\left(\\int_\\Omega\\int_\\Omega G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\,d\\lambda_\\Omega(x)\\,d\\lambda_\\Omega(y)\\right)^{1/p}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\ \\to\\ [u]_{s,p;\\Omega}=\n\\left(\\int_\\Omega\\int_\\Omega G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\,d\\lambda_\\Omega(x)\\,d\\lambda_\\Omega(y)\\right)^{1/p}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W^{s,p}(\\Omega)=\\{u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega):[u]_{s,p;\\Omega}&lt;\\infty\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W^{s,p}(\\Omega)=\\{u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega):[u]_{s,p;\\Omega}&lt;\\infty\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\in W^{s,p}(\\Omega)\\ \\to\\ \\|u\\|_{W^{s,p}(\\Omega)}=\n\\left(\\|u\\|_{L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)}^p+[u]_{s,p;\\Omega}^p\\right)^{1/p}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\in W^{s,p}(\\Omega)\\ \\to\\ \\|u\\|_{W^{s,p}(\\Omega)}=\n\\left(\\|u\\|_{L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)}^p+[u]_{s,p;\\Omega}^p\\right)^{1/p}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The formulas are invariant under changing representatives on a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_\\Omega\">\\(\\lambda_\\Omega\\)</span>-null set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{s,p}\">\\(W^{s,p}\\)</span> interpolates between <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{1,p}\">\\(W^{1,p}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>On a bounded Lipschitz domain, the standard trace theorem requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;1/p\">\\(s&gt;1/p\\)</span>; the target trace space depends on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,p\">\\(s,p\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial\\Omega\">\\(\\partial\\Omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Applications: nonlocal PDE, peridynamics, image processing.</li>\n<li>Point evaluation is performed on a measurable representative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>, while the seminorm is attached to its <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> equivalence class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>; changing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> on a null set does not change the product-measure integral.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lp-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)$，$f\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega$ 且 $u=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)$ (see [[58-df-lp-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\cap\\Omega:B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)\\}\\land\\lambda_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\lambda^n\\upharpoonright\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in(0,1)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"u=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\cdot]_{s,p;\\Omega}:L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"W^{s,p}(\\Omega)\\subseteq L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}\\in[0,\\infty)^{\\Omega\\times\\Omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}=\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,x\\rangle,0\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\}\n\\cup\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\frac{|f(x)-f(y)|^p}{\\|x-y\\|_2^{n+sp}}\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in\\Omega\\land x\\ne y\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"u=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\ \\to\\ [u]_{s,p;\\Omega}=\n\\left(\\int_\\Omega\\int_\\Omega G_{f,s,p,n,\\Omega}(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\,d\\lambda_\\Omega(x)\\,d\\lambda_\\Omega(y)\\right)^{1/p}.","display":true},{"tex":"W^{s,p}(\\Omega)=\\{u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega):[u]_{s,p;\\Omega}<\\infty\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"u\\in W^{s,p}(\\Omega)\\ \\to\\ \\|u\\|_{W^{s,p}(\\Omega)}=\n\\left(\\|u\\|_{L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)}^p+[u]_{s,p;\\Omega}^p\\right)^{1/p}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"W^{s,p}","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false},{"tex":"W^{1,p}","display":false},{"tex":"s>1/p","display":false},{"tex":"s,p","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":2539,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-551","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-fractional-sobolev.md|58-df-fractional-sobolev]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a1d034d5d39b4a14","4884f45058a56aac","5111035a66b30703"]}